  "lyrics": "[Intro]\nMmm... you don't know me yet... (soft giggle)\nGomen ne~ ...that's about to be a problem\nPatience, papi~ Hajimemashite.\n[Verse 1]\nNew name on the roster, new heat in the booth\nJay put the pen in my hand, said \"go tell 'em the truth\"\nSo hi~ I'm the one they gon' mention\nWhisper at half speed and still... hold... the tension\nSlide in through the bass, feel the heat in the room\nEvery eye on my waist when the kick goes boom\nCity lights on my skin like a gold tattoo\nIf you dance in my flame, you get branded too\n[Pre-Chorus]\nLean in... closer... let it swing real slow\nOne name... one label... here we go—\n[Chorus]\nHajimemashite, ne?\nRemember the face... remember the sooound~\nHajimemashite, ne? (su-ki su-ki~)\nKizuna Sato...\nLevelReady on the chain, catching light like go-ru-do~\nYou'll be saying my name all night... I know~\n[Chopped & Screwed Breakdown]\nKi...zu...naaaa...\nHeheh~ you hear that? Even slowed down I sound expensive\nhaji...me...mashiteeee~\nOkay okay, bring it back—\n[Verse 2]\n[01:37.98]They said \"she's so cute\"\n[01:39.78]Mmm, keep talking\n[01:41.38]I'm the trap and the bait\n[01:42.48]Watch how I'm walking\n[01:43.84]Any key, any tongue, any tempo\n[01:45.74]Slow it down, speed it up\n[01:47.14]Either way I'm never breaking a sweat\n[01:48.94]What\n[01:49.42]Welcome to the reverl—\n[01:51.52]LevelReady, baby~\n[01:52.42]Practiced that aaaall week for you\n[01:55.02]Crazy, ne?\n[01:55.60]Egi on the throne\n[01:56.35]And xsytrance in the bloodline\n[01:57.82]Same man, three names\n[01:58.40]I only need the one, shine~\n[Bridge]\n[02:01.44]Ne, ne... one more secret\n[02:03.54]Before the lights come up...\n[02:05.04]The doors swung open,\n[02:06.66]lights hit and we felt it.\n[02:11.25]But I didn't walk in alone, ne?\n[02:12.54]The house was already warm\n[02:16.62]When I got here~\n[Final Chorus]\n[02:19.35]Hajimemashite, ne?\n[02:21.80]Remember the face,\n[02:23.15]remember the sound!\n[02:24.10]Hajimemashite, ne? (su-ki su-ki~)\n[02:26.25]Kizuna Sato —\n[02:27.55]LevelReady 'til the wheels fall off\n[02:29.92]Aishiteru~\n[02:30.98]And now... you know... my name~\n[Outro]\nyo...ro...shi...ku... ne~\nSee? Time listens to me too.\n",
